I come out of the temporary room.
I bring my heavy suitcase into the corridor.
A small bag is kept on top of the suitcase.
My neighbour Asha is also in the corridor.
She comes near me.
She smiles and says, "Hello Maya!"
I say, "Hello Asha!"
Asha happily takes my small bag.
Now the small bag is in her hand.
I say, "Thank you Asha!"
My new flat is in this building.
It is very near.
We both walk together.
Asha walks ahead of me.
I slowly pull the heavy suitcase on the floor.
We arrive near the door of the new flat.
My real home is now in front of me.
